# Line endings (role migration Stage 1 hosted rollout, Nov 19, 2026).
#
# The rollout was run from a Windows checkout, which converted line endings. The seven
# database functions created by the Stage 1 migrations were stored on the hosted project
# with Windows line endings. That is harmless (SQL treats them as spaces) but it means
# the hosted code wasn't byte-identical to what was reviewed. These rules keep database
# migrations, rollback scripts and Edge Function / app code byte-identical on every
# computer, so what reaches Supabase is exactly what was reviewed.
*.sql text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
